### SkillSetu Integration API samples (VS Code / BAS "REST Client": click "Send Request" above each call)
@host = http://localhost:4004/integration/v1
@key = skillsetu-demo-key

### 1. Create a case from a story (copy the caseID from the answer into @case below)
POST {{host}}/createCase
x-api-key: {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "story": "मैं 12 साल से गाँव में स्वयं सहायता समूह चला रही हूँ। हर महीने मीटिंग बुलाती हूँ और बचत का हिसाब रखती हूँ।", "name": "Sunita", "externalRef": "NGO-4411", "district": "Jaipur" }

###
@case = PASTE-CASE-ID-HERE

### 2. Job matches (part-time only)
GET {{host}}/getMatches?caseID={{case}}&partTime=true
x-api-key: {{key}}

### 3. Learning plan
GET {{host}}/getLearningPlan?caseID={{case}}
x-api-key: {{key}}

### 4. Bias & readiness report
GET {{host}}/getReadiness?caseID={{case}}
x-api-key: {{key}}

### 5. Send to a counsellor (then approve it on the Counsellor page)
POST {{host}}/submitForReview
x-api-key: {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "caseID": "{{case}}" }

### 6. After approval: hand over to SAP SuccessFactors
POST {{host}}/pushToSuccessFactors
x-api-key: {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "caseID": "{{case}}" }

### 7. See what "SuccessFactors" received (demo mock)
GET http://localhost:4004/sf-mock/JobApplication

### 8. Register a webhook (use https://webhook.site to get a test URL)
POST {{host}}/registerWebhook
x-api-key: {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "url": "https://webhook.site/your-id", "events": ["case.approved", "case.pushed"] }
